  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "tr_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Truchet tiles\n\nThe Tiles node in `truchet` mode: every cell holds two quarter circles (the `arcs` set), turned one of two ways. With `noise` above 0 the turns follow Perlin noise instead of a coin toss, so they clump into regions and the arcs join into long meandering loops. Each turn takes its own colour.\n\nTry the `diagonals` and `triangles` sets, or `noise` 0.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Truchet tiles\n\nThe Tiles node in `truchet` mode: every cell holds two quarter circles (the `arcs` set), turned one of two ways. With `noise` above 0 the turns follow Perlin noise instead of a coin toss, so they clump into regions and the arcs join into long meandering loops. Each turn takes its own colour.\n\nTry the `diagonals` and `triangles` sets, or `noise` 0.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
